WEBVTT

00:09:59.461 --> 00:10:02.543
♪ Todos os meus hábitos ruins
têm que ir, têm que ir embora ♪

00:10:03.381 --> 00:10:04.532
♪ Virem comigo ♪

00:10:04.556 --> 00:10:06.557
(Beatbox)

00:10:20.292 --> 00:10:21.442
Prontos?

00:10:22.651 --> 00:10:23.801
Batam palmas comigo.

00:10:25.705 --> 00:10:27.713
(Palmas)